From: amansing <amansing@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Apr 2026 14:40:52 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] arm: pmu: Enable PMU Events w.r.t. core architecture

Update PMU Events by identifying the core architecture from MIDR->PART

Change-Id: Ib7d0b9f5869b030a236103498fb34304fe3bd909
Signed-off-by: amansing <amansing@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
